  "releaseNotes": "Fix wait poll misses being reported as errors: Waits drives WebDriverWait.Until(d => d.FindElement(..)) through VerisoftDriver, so every poll miss fired DriverListener.OnError at error level before WebDriverWait retried, flooding ReportPortal with \"Error during 'FindElement'\" lines for waits that ultimately succeeded. NoSuchElementException and StaleElementReferenceException are now reported at debug level; all other exception types remain at error level.",
